        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "*** VERY SPACIOUS 2 BED / 2 BATH APARTMENT *** Can come Fully FURNISHED or Unfurnished ******* SPACIOUS SUNNY BALCONY ******** SUPERB LOCATION NEXT TO TRAIN STATION *** COMING SOON!! *** \r\n\r\nRay Cooke Lettings are delighted to present this bright & spacious two-bedroom apartment to the market in the ever popular and extremely sought after location of The Academy Building, Parkwest, Dublin 12. The truly stunning development is set in Parkwest Pointe and is just a stone's throw from Cherry Orchard/Parkwest Station, bringing you straight to Heuston Station within minutes. \r\n\r\nDublin City Centre is only a short drive or a quick hop on the nearby public transport routes. The apartment is very well laid out with well-proportioned light-filled rooms throughout. The location is ideal being close to every conceivable amenity including schools, shops, bars and restaurants, parks, sports and leisure facilities, public transport and within walking distance of Clondalkin Village, Cherry Orchard/Parkwest Train Station and numerous bus routes. Bright and spacious living accommodation comprises of entrance hall, lounge, kitchen, dining area, balcony, two double bedrooms (one with ensuite) and main bathroom. Viewing is highly recommended. \r\n\r\nKey Features: Beautiful 2 Bed / 2 Bath Apartment. Fully furnished throughout. Immaculately presented. 2 x Double Bedrooms with fitted wardrobes. Spacious sunny balcony with leafy views. Fully fitted modern kitchen with all mod cons. Large open plan living spaces. Fully tiled bathrooms. Secure underground parking. Very sought after development. Parkwest Train Station on your doorstep. A host of local amenities close by. Various transport links just minutes away. Available now."
